{
  "source": "Prompts/when-you-need-more-8.mp4",
  "duration": 163.189875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.16,
      "text": "For many tasks, you open your AI app, ask a question, and keep the conversation going."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.72,
      "end": 10.8,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI. You might need help working through a complicated plan,"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.3,
      "end": 14.5,
      "text": "weighing options, or investigating information across sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.32,
      "end": 19.24,
      "text": "Depending on the app and your subscription, you may have three other choices for these"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.24,
      "end": 25.08,
      "text": "demanding tasks. The model, thinking, and research. You won't need to change them every time."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.36,
      "end": 28.64,
      "text": "But knowing what they do helps you get a significantly better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.64,
      "end": 35.62,
      "text": "When you use an AI app, an LLM powers its answers. Think of it as the engine inside the app."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.34,
      "end": 41.18,
      "text": "Choosing a model means choosing your engine. Different models have different capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.94,
      "end": 45.5,
      "text": "You start with the default, but can upgrade to a more capable one when needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.26,
      "end": 50.24,
      "text": "On the which model graphic, the everyday model is for quick questions, like"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.24,
      "end": 55.5,
      "text": "suggest a funny movie to watch tonight. The more capable model handles demanding tasks."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.5,
      "end": 59.3,
      "text": "For example, help me plan a summer business, including costs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.58,
      "end": 63.22,
      "text": "pricing, and how many customers I'll need. By making that selection,"
    },
    {
      "start": 63.66,
      "end": 68.7,
      "text": "you physically swap the underlying engine for one built to handle heavy-duty, detailed planning."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.58,
      "end": 73.38,
      "text": "Choosing a model changes your LLM, but thinking is a different variable."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.92,
      "end": 78.48,
      "text": "It doesn't change the engine. It changes how much time the AI spends working through your task."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.16,
      "end": 85.04,
      "text": "It uses extra computational time to work through steps, weigh options, and check its answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 85.04,
      "end": 91.06,
      "text": "before responding. With less thinking, ask, turn these notes from our group meeting into a clear"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.06,
      "end": 95.96,
      "text": "checklist. With more thinking, ask, help us divide this project among four people."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.5,
      "end": 100.52,
      "text": "We have one week, different schedules, and only two people know how to edit video."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.5,
      "end": 106.0,
      "text": "Selecting more thinking grants the AI the necessary time allowance to untangle"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.0,
      "end": 111.14,
      "text": "multi-variable logic puzzles. There is one more option, research."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.78,
      "end": 115.94,
      "text": "This mode gathers information from different websites and brings it together so you can"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.94,
      "end": 120.56,
      "text": "compare your options. Regular chat can look things up on the internet too, but research"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.56,
      "end": 125.46,
      "text": "is designed for a fuller, comprehensive investigation across several sources simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.48,
      "end": 131.12,
      "text": "For regular chat, I live in Dallas. How long would it take me to drive to Texas A&M"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.12,
      "end": 136.72,
      "text": "in College Station versus UT Austin? For deep research, I want to study physics and"
    },
    {
      "start": 136.72,
      "end": 140.82,
      "text": "am considering Texas A&M and UT Austin. Compare their physics programs,"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.38,
      "end": 145.96,
      "text": "undergraduate research opportunities, admissions requirements, and costs. Show your sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.02,
      "end": 150.44,
      "text": "Deep research transforms the AI from a quick reference guide"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.44,
      "end": 154.74,
      "text": "into a web investigator capable of synthesizing vast amounts of data."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.4,
      "end": 159.7,
      "text": "Model. Thinking. Research. Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
